<section class="sk-section not-prose" id="fees">
  <div class="sk-wrap">
    <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">
      <h2 class="sk-h2">Know what you’re paying for.</h2>
      <p class="sk-lead mx-auto mt-4">
        We clearly distinguish our service fees from government and third-party charges.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="sk-card">
        <h3>Our service fee</h3>
        <p>The amount charged by SK Immigration for the agreed service. You’ll receive a written scope before payment.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="sk-card">
        <h3>Government / third-party fees</h3>
        <p>Separate fees charged by governments, embassies, universities, visa centres and other providers — paid to them, not to us.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
